{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22325","headline":"暮春寄元九 · 白居易","name":"暮春寄元九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"棃花结成实，燕卵化爲雏。\n时物又若此，道情复何如。\n但觉日月促，不嗟年岁徂。\n浮生都是梦，老小亦何殊。\n唯与故人别，江陵初谪居。\n时时一相见，此意未全除。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22325.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22325","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}